<title>USA: U.S. Spring/White Wheat - Bids mostly higher.</title>
<headline>U.S. Spring/White Wheat - Bids mostly higher.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dark northern spring wheat cash bids were mostly higher on Friday as dealers noted sporadic movement.</p>
<p>&quot;Movement was really quiet. Basis is still soft today again on the lower protein content wheat,&quot; a Minneapolis dealer said. &quot;Some more spot cars are showing up but farmer selling in the country was still very slow.&quot;</p>
<p>In Montana, producers were focusing on winter wheat seeding ahead of a forecast of mixed rain and snow this weekend.</p>
<p>One Oregon dealer said he had some &quot;panic&quot; selling from producers but he pointed out the lack of exports to support the market.  </p>
